> > > Userspace can get to know the XRUN state by calling some APIs. Then,
> > > it can recover PCM substream by executing SNDRV_PCM_IOCTL_PREPARE
> > > ioctl.
> > 
> > I think we can use snd_pcm_stop_xrun() for this purpose.
